.TH RFID-MODE-RESET-ROOT-IF-CURRENT 1 "2026-07-28" "GWAY local tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rfid-mode-reset-root-if-current \- return RFID navigation to root after one-shot actions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rfid-mode-reset-root-if-current
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Resets the RFID mode-runner navigation state to root only when the current state
still matches the provided card, script, and latest scan values.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --config-dir " DIR"
RFID mode configuration directory.
.TP
.BI --card " CARD"
Expected current card.
.TP
.BI --script " FILE"
Expected current script path.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rfid-mode-runner (1)
